WEBVTT

00:29.950 --> 00:31.510
I'm glad you decided to come.

00:31.910 --> 00:36.020
Note... or rather, Arthur Leywin.

00:37.270 --> 00:40.530
You were the one who defeated 
the Elder Woods, yes?

00:43.400 --> 00:45.610
<i>He's strong, and dangerous.</i>

00:46.650 --> 00:48.320
<i>More than anyone I've ever encountered.</i>

02:19.510 --> 02:24.510
#12 The King Enrolls.

02:21.740 --> 02:25.380
<i>If I'm the target...
is Lucas behind this?</i>

02:26.260 --> 02:27.880
Who sent you?

02:29.640 --> 02:34.340
That fledgling you have in 
mind has served his purpose.

02:34.340 --> 02:36.220
<i>He's not lying.</i>

02:36.220 --> 02:38.280
<i>Lucas is nothing compared 
to whoever this is.</i>

02:38.680 --> 02:41.680
The Wykes family has provided some value,

02:41.680 --> 02:45.250
but now there's a matter that 
takes greater precedence,

02:45.580 --> 02:50.650
considering a single adventurer was 
able to defeat the Elder Woods.

02:55.880 --> 03:01.790
Arthur Leywin... his father, 
Reynolds, and his mother, Alice.

03:02.040 --> 03:07.800
Born 12 years ago. Awakened his 
mana core at the tender age of two,

03:07.800 --> 03:10.730
before moving to Xyrus City.

03:12.000 --> 03:15.890
His family was attacked by bandits 
en route, leading to his disappearance.

03:15.890 --> 03:18.940
He reunited with his family 
three years later.

03:19.370 --> 03:21.430
He registered with the 
adventurer's guild at age ten,

03:21.760 --> 03:23.560
under the alias of "Note."

03:23.930 --> 03:28.690
He had a stint as an adventurer at 
the side of Jasmine Flamesworth.

03:29.310 --> 03:33.070
Your parents were members of 
the Twinhorns as well, yes?

03:33.310 --> 03:35.820
<i>He retraced the path I've taken.</i>

03:36.300 --> 03:38.780
You certainly seem knowledgeable about me.

03:39.270 --> 03:40.570
Are you a fan, by any chance?

03:40.570 --> 03:41.830
Don't bother.

03:43.080 --> 03:46.830
I'm not here to fight. I'm just curious.

03:47.230 --> 03:51.790
The guild records say Note... 
that is to say, you,

03:51.790 --> 03:54.710
defeated the Elder Woods by yourself.

03:54.710 --> 03:56.090
How did you manage that?

03:56.680 --> 03:58.830
Brald and the others were there, too.

03:58.830 --> 04:01.690
He wasn't strong enough to 
manage something like that.

04:01.690 --> 04:03.220
What makes you so sure?

04:03.220 --> 04:06.160
I have a very good grasp 
of his strength,

04:06.520 --> 04:10.330
since I was the one who sent him there.

04:12.900 --> 04:13.980
I see.

04:15.530 --> 04:16.770
It was you.

04:18.040 --> 04:19.280
You have to pay.

04:29.450 --> 04:30.510
<i>What was that?</i>

04:37.270 --> 04:39.050
Sonic magic?!

04:39.400 --> 04:41.000
That's only the beginning.

04:54.650 --> 04:57.080
<i>The interval between his 
casting is so short,</i>

04:57.510 --> 04:59.570
<i>and he has access to a myriad of elements.</i>

05:00.720 --> 05:02.860
<i>Is this some form of magic I don't know?</i>

05:10.190 --> 05:12.090
<i>But with this timing...</i>

05:33.980 --> 05:39.750
Your swordplay and mana control could 
both be described as first-rate.

05:39.750 --> 05:45.990
Yet, there's still more. I can tell, 
having seen many a mana beast before.

05:46.390 --> 05:50.760
The power that inhabits your 
mana core is... one of a kind.

05:53.000 --> 05:57.750
It was you who killed the 
Elder Woods, Arthur Leywin.

06:00.100 --> 06:02.510
You said you've seen many mana beasts.

06:03.080 --> 06:06.010
I take it you're behind the 
strangeness in the Beast Glades?

06:06.010 --> 06:10.540
It was a very convenient location 
to test the results of my research.

06:11.030 --> 06:12.520
Nothing more.

06:12.860 --> 06:18.720
Now, tell me... how did you 
defeat the Elder Woods—

06:26.070 --> 06:27.450
You little wretch.

06:28.780 --> 06:31.540
You've been holding back.

06:31.750 --> 06:34.390
I'm not foolish enough 
to expose myself to a foe

06:34.390 --> 06:36.540
I don't know the identity or objective of.

06:38.270 --> 06:41.940
Now, answer me. What are you after?

06:42.380 --> 06:43.300
You—

06:47.230 --> 06:51.310
I wouldn't shout too much. 
Considering where you chose to meet...

06:55.030 --> 06:57.560
I doubt you want to draw much attention.

06:58.810 --> 07:01.570
What in the world are you?

07:12.910 --> 07:14.090
I want answers.

07:16.310 --> 07:20.220
There's no doubt of it. 
You beat the Elder Woods.

07:21.720 --> 07:25.810
I suppose my curiosity has led me 
to catch a tiger by its tail.

07:27.840 --> 07:31.710
My objective is control over mana beasts.

07:31.710 --> 07:34.850
I'm looking to complete the 
spell necessary for that.

07:34.850 --> 07:38.590
I can already control 
 anything A-class and below.

07:38.590 --> 07:43.870
But S-class mana beasts 
are still beyond me.

07:44.260 --> 07:47.140
You weren't controlling the Elder Woods?

07:49.180 --> 07:53.700
The wills of S-class beasts 
keep me from taking control.

07:55.070 --> 07:59.220
So I took measures to remove their will!

08:04.380 --> 08:07.340
I wasn't in control of the Elder Woods.

08:07.340 --> 08:12.220
But by removing its will, I was 
able to broadly direct its actions.

08:12.220 --> 08:16.530
Directing it to kill anyone 
who entered the cave!

08:17.830 --> 08:19.750
This is a strengthening potion

08:19.750 --> 08:24.230
that explosively increases 
mana at the cost of lost will.

08:24.230 --> 08:28.040
It's my first time using it on a human.
Desperate times, you understand.

08:29.300 --> 08:33.990
My anonymity is too precious to me!

08:36.100 --> 08:39.120
<i>He's too dangerous! I have to 
stop him from getting away!</i>

10:09.230 --> 10:10.940
What's going on out there?!

10:10.940 --> 10:12.260
Mom...

10:14.630 --> 10:16.860
Arthur... Where's Arthur?

10:19.390 --> 10:21.270
Elijah, have you seen Arthur?

10:22.560 --> 10:23.770
He's missing?!

10:33.630 --> 10:36.530
People I care about live beyond here.

10:37.660 --> 10:38.780
I don't care who you are.

10:39.530 --> 10:41.290
You will not pass!

11:27.440 --> 11:29.290
How about this?!

11:51.780 --> 11:55.400
<i>He has the physical abilities 
of an S-class mana beast.</i>

11:55.400 --> 11:58.160
<i>And on top of that, he can cast magic...</i>

11:58.670 --> 12:00.410
<i>with an incredible level of output.</i>

12:03.220 --> 12:06.160
<i>Neither my swords or spells 
are having any effect!</i>

12:07.580 --> 12:08.670
<i>What else?</i>

12:10.830 --> 12:12.300
<i>What else can I do?</i>

12:14.170 --> 12:15.420
<i>Damn it—</i>

12:45.830 --> 12:47.200
<i>I see.</i>

12:47.910 --> 12:49.960
<i>Then, loss...</i>

12:50.500 --> 12:52.600
<i>To deprive others...</i>

12:54.550 --> 12:56.450
<i>This is what it feels like.</i>

13:06.120 --> 13:08.830
<i>If this ending...</i>

13:09.600 --> 13:13.230
<i>is the penance for my previous life,</i>

13:13.710 --> 13:15.250
<i>then there's nothing I...</i>

13:27.820 --> 13:28.500
<i>Grandma?</i>

13:29.030 --> 13:36.380
Arthur. What will you do with 
that power, if you get stronger?

13:41.940 --> 13:46.640
I'll protect... 
the people... I care about.

14:08.410 --> 14:09.540
Here I come!

14:27.850 --> 14:30.930
Absolute Zero!

14:58.140 --> 15:02.480
<i>I have taken... so many lives,</i>

15:03.380 --> 15:05.470
<i>and brought so many nations to ruin.</i>

15:06.630 --> 15:10.470
<i>But even then... in spite of that—</i>

15:11.210 --> 15:12.440
Arthur...

15:23.850 --> 15:26.610
I will not be beaten!

16:13.040 --> 16:14.490
Enough of you!

16:29.640 --> 16:32.990
"Don't let your heart fill 
with hatred and rage."

16:33.980 --> 16:39.150
How many times have I broken 
my promise to you already?

16:40.800 --> 16:43.220
<i>Forgive me, Sylvia.</i>

16:45.350 --> 16:48.040
I guess I shouldn't stick around here.

17:00.920 --> 17:02.380
You look a mess.

17:02.660 --> 17:05.380
You?! We've got bigger concerns!

17:05.670 --> 17:07.610
Listen to me! That boy—

17:07.610 --> 17:10.210
The city is a mess.

17:10.210 --> 17:12.760
Covering it up is going to 
be an absolute nightmare.

17:12.760 --> 17:14.640
That! Doesn't! Matter!

17:14.950 --> 17:20.100
That's no ordinary beast inside the boy!
 Its power surpasses S-class!

17:20.100 --> 17:23.020
Like something of legend or mythology—

17:24.120 --> 17:27.310
Wait. No, but that's...

17:27.670 --> 17:29.890
Yet, it has to be.

17:30.520 --> 17:33.150
He has a dragon's—

17:38.630 --> 17:40.660
Wh-Why?

17:46.730 --> 17:48.420
<i>The day after the attack,</i>

17:49.260 --> 17:54.680
<i>I was barely able to avoid giving 
Alice and Eleanor any real answers.</i>

17:55.620 --> 17:57.930
<i>I had a little bit of help.</i>

17:58.680 --> 18:01.020
<i>"A mana beast escaped and ran amuck."</i>

18:01.020 --> 18:03.690
<i>"Academy Director Cynthia 
assisted in its recapture."</i>

18:04.170 --> 18:06.000
<i>That was the story that was told.</i>

18:08.190 --> 18:11.190
<i>Reynolds didn't ask questions.</i>

18:11.930 --> 18:15.950
<i>Possibly because he'd realized something.</i>

18:17.140 --> 18:22.920
<i>I returned to the ruins of the church,
 hoping to find some clues,</i>

18:22.920 --> 18:24.460
<i>but there was nothing.</i>

18:25.100 --> 18:29.460
<i>My memories of that day are 
something I will never forget,</i>

18:30.100 --> 18:33.790
<i>but they will be buried by other 
memories as time goes by.</i>

18:43.280 --> 18:48.730
<i>Time spent away from battle, 
with the people I care about...</i>

18:49.060 --> 18:52.490
<i>was more valuable than 
anything I could imagine.</i>

19:02.630 --> 19:04.250
<i>Sonic magic...</i>

19:05.000 --> 19:06.010
<i>Was that her?</i>

19:19.610 --> 19:26.270
You who will become the future leaders, 
scholars, and movers of Dicathen...

19:26.270 --> 19:30.070
I welcome you to our humble academy.

19:30.070 --> 19:33.250
I am Cynthia Goodsky, the director.

19:33.820 --> 19:36.460
And I get the feeling this 
will be a very special year.

19:36.860 --> 19:41.840
There has never been a class with 
so many elves and dwarves enrolled,

19:41.840 --> 19:43.620
for one thing.

19:43.620 --> 19:46.560
And I can imagine no 
better way to greet you,

19:46.560 --> 19:50.130
than with a word from your 
student body's representatives;

19:50.810 --> 19:54.680
a round of applause, please, 
for your student council.

21:43.120 --> 21:43.990
Sylvie!

21:57.710 --> 22:03.470
"Come along now. It's safe.
You can go home."

22:05.760 --> 22:09.890
"I don't think so. A tree golem could 
eat a child like me in no time."

22:11.050 --> 22:12.770
"Then, do you know which 
direction you came from?"

22:12.990 --> 22:17.520
"Can't say that I do. I was chasing 
some bugs and then I got lost."

22:19.690 --> 22:21.100
"Okay, then."

22:21.900 --> 22:24.850
"What's your name?"

22:24.850 --> 22:27.530
"It's Tessia. Tessia Eralith."

22:27.950 --> 22:29.540
"What's yours?"

22:29.880 --> 22:31.540
"Arthur Leywin."

22:34.520 --> 22:38.170
It's funny how we both remember 
so much of what we said.

22:38.170 --> 22:39.300
Tell me about it.

22:40.060 --> 22:42.540
It's been a while, Arthur.

22:42.540 --> 22:44.770
It really has, Tess.
